    cmns-org:manages fibo-fbc-fct-usjrga:UniformBankPerformanceReportRepository ;
    cmns-rlcmp:isPlayedBy fibo-fbc-fct-usjrga:FederalFinancialInstitutionsExaminationCouncil .

